@startuml
title Order
[*] --> Pending
Pending --> Paid : payment received
Pending -down-> Cancelled : timeout
state Paid {
  [*] --> Picking
  Picking --> Packed
  Packed --> [*]
}
Paid --> Shipped : handed to carrier
state "Out for delivery" as Out
Shipped --> Out
Out --> Delivered
Delivered --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
note right of Cancelled : the stock is released
@enduml
